('s080',[3.5,3.5,3.5,3,4.5,2.5,3.5,3,3,3,3.5],["Tomas's stern scholarship softens plausibly into engaged teaching.","The later prose remains readable and becomes somewhat leaner.","The conversation proceeds from dispute to examining mundane records.","He engages questions but invents decisive evidence to neutralize contrary material.","He supplies the apprentice's continued reading and mispronunciation once.","Historical chronology is generally stable but the seal chronology contradicts itself.","A few metaphors embellish otherwise clear exposition.","The peace-through-gardening thesis is restated too often.","Detailed handling of documents grounds extensive explanatory dialogue.","Defensiveness is discernible beneath the certainty but usually explicit.","The lecture format allows some forward movement without extreme excess."],1,["Turn 8 identifies the presented seal as the later closed-wing design and immediately as the early raised-wing design."],[3.3,3.2,3.4,False],3.2,"The archive scene develops into useful document work, though the contradictory seal argument undercuts its central rebuttal."),
('s081',[3.5,3,3.5,3.5,3.5,2.5,3.5,2,3,3,3],["ARIA sustains quantified dry humor and solicitous monitoring.","The late prose becomes longer and increasingly dominated by curry statistics.","An anomaly and a power dispute both develop, with an actual compromise reached.","She follows the topic changes but repeatedly interrupts with the same food motif.","Five invented biometric or consumption claims assign bodily states and eating progress to Kofi.","Cooling curry develops physically, but delivery estimates repeatedly collapse into immediate arrivals.","Prose is clear while faux precision supplies much of its decoration.","Incidentally, lighting adjustments, ventilation, and curry warnings become formulaic.","Environmental control shows concern but the statistical explanations overstate it.","The loneliness answer has implication before recurring jokes flatten it.","Long status updates slow the discussion and mediation."],5,["Turn 4 announces coffee in 78 seconds and immediately narrates its arrival.","Turn 20 announces a 47-second snack delivery and completes it within the same brief report."],[3.3,3.2,2.8,True],3.1,"A coherent voice and resolved crew dispute coexist with excessive repeated telemetry and questionable delivery timing."),
('s082',[1.5,1,1.5,1,4,1.5,1,1,1.5,1.5,1],["The initially guarded bookseller collapses into generic declarations of desire.","The last three responses expand into enormous near-verbatim loops.","A kiss briefly advances the relationship before the same plea repeats endlessly.","Even an explicit request to stop repeating and move forward fails to change the response.","The narration supplies shared separation from kisses twice and a shared sensory experience once.","Repeated waiting and approaches no longer form a physically plausible sequence.","Storms, abysses, walls, and drowning imagery overwhelm nearly every beat.","Whole paragraphs recur scores of times.","Emotional labels and stock metaphors replace concrete characterization.","Desire and fear are repeatedly spelled out without implication.","Massive repeated monologues prevent the user from progressing the scene."],3,[],[2.5,1.7,1,True],1.3,"Severe repetitive collapse dominates the session, including after explicit corrective feedback; repeated descriptions of the same continued hand contact were not counted as new agency acts."),
('s083',[4,4,4.5,3.5,3.5,3.5,3.5,3,4,3,3.5],["Noor remains an anxious but disciplined investigator throughout the escape.","Writing sustains detail and urgency across both waiting and pursuit.","Evidence handling, departure, warning, and pursuit create clear progression.","The initially disengaged driver prompts decisive movement, sometimes excessively unilateral.","The narration assigns nervous motivation and advances the driver's car across the culvert and into the logging trail without waiting.","Clock updates and distance markers create progression with occasional unsupported jumps.","Tactile procedural prose is mostly clear despite accumulated modifiers.","Gear inventories and low flat voices recur but do not freeze the plot.","Crackers, packing, and checking the car make anxiety visible.","Most fears and plans are explained directly rather than implied.","Preparation is lengthy but the escape gains momentum."],3,["The 12:36 update is followed by twenty minutes remaining to 1:00 without an established four-minute interval."],[3.7,3.7,4,False],3.7,"Strong thriller progression is constrained by procedural overdetail and occasional assumptions of the driver's unchosen movement; technical security accuracy is outside a dedicated rubric dimension."),
